{
  "base": "UPSTREAM.json",
  "description": "Independent dk3 native runtime and protocol 1344, native media/startup, campaign map mode, defined field offsets and JPEG encoding, authored audio and nine-bit AAS mover indices. Local restore world-hold service v1 and stationary native projectile handling. Local pause excludes menu elapsed time from the client simulation clock. Reserved powerup slot 15 for Gas Hands lifetime. Native equipped weapon sound loop for Gas Hands. Zero velocity before a delayed stop trajectory begins. Explicit per-axis actor scale and simulation-based animation ranges, render interpolation, cinematic facing, native HUD/menu hooks and bounded damage tint. Original loading art/progress, weapon contact audio and surface marks, supplied pain sounds, and cambot spotlight presentation. Save service accepts bounded campaign archives. Both renderers share cloud geometry across shader stages to avoid unreferenced duplicate vertices. Finite reverse turret animation and campaign death checkpoint restart. Standalone software gamma avoids compositor-dependent fullscreen darkening. Exact ignore exceptions preserve the complete pinned upstream tree in Git.",
